# Mailtrap Sending API is the active mailer for now — real emails (claims,
# sticker issuance, user account creation, quotation generation, etc.) go
# out through Mailtrap while NAV's codeunit functions aren't live yet.
# NAV and SMTP stay fully configured below; switch MAIL_MAILER back to "nav"
# or "smtp" whenever you're ready, nothing else needs to change.
